author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Toute modification d'attribut m\u00e9tier doit \u00eatre trac\u00e9e dans audit_log avec delta JSON avant/apr\u00e8s."}, {"id": "claude_md_rg12_unicite_processus", "label": "RG-12 Unicit\u00e9 du processus mensuel", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "section 7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Un seul processus mensuel par combinaison mois/ann\u00e9e (UNIQUE en base) ; distincte de RG-03 malgr\u00e9 une mention ambigu\u00eb ant\u00e9rieure dans les user stories V3."}, {"id": "claude_md_contrats_api_34_endpoints", "label": "Contrats API : 34 endpoints", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "section 8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_md_keycloak_simulation_dev", "label": "Simulation Keycloak en d\u00e9veloppement", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "section 13", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "En d\u00e9veloppement, simuler Keycloak avec une instance locale ou l'authentification locale BCrypt ; en production, pointer vers le realm Keycloak r\u00e9el de la banque."}, {"id": "claude_md_deploiement_k8s", "label": "D\u00e9ploiement Kubernetes (microservice conteneuris\u00e9)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "section 14", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "D\u00e9cision confirm\u00e9e par le manager DSI : DOTTEL est un microservice conteneuris\u00e9 orchestr\u00e9 par Kubernetes, sans service registry ni gateway pour l'instant."}, {"id": "claude_md_erreurs_a_ne_jamais_commettre", "label": "Erreurs \u00e0 ne jamais commettre (20 points)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": "section 18", "source_url":